es only author or provenance and must fail history verification and health; compose with re-anchoring preservation instead of erasing original evidence; pass history, merge, restore, SDK, CLI, security, static, and exact coverage gates."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-o2kc"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"critical"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reporter","value":"GitHub issue #1178"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"critical"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"pm-cli 2026.9.2 with a fresh single-entry item history stream"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Create an item, edit only the stored history record author and agent_provenance fields, remove the drift cache, then run pm health --strict-exit and pm history <id> --verify --strict-exit; both exit zero."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A versioned history-integrity epoch covers immutable record metadata as well as item-state hashes, accepts legacy epochs explicitly, documents migration/repair, and rejects attribution tampering with an executable negative control."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Record attribution and operation metadata sit outside the hashed content, so they can be rewritten while the item hash chain and health gate remain clean."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"Core history ledger, SDK verification, health, and repair compatibility"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/customer_impact","value":"Reviewers and agents can receive a green integrity verdict after attribution was modified during merge, rebase, or manual repair."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-9yfo","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-09-02T21:14:35.285Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-aka8m7","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-